      tag.
  - id: Actuator
    targetObjects:
    - {fileID: 534178784}
    subheading: Actuator
    infoText: Converts pneumatic or electrical energy into mechanical movement.
  - id: Camera
    targetObjects:
    - {fileID: 4491427202340835071}
    subheading: Camera
    infoText: Captures images to detect, identify and inspect the workpiece.
  - id: MCB
    targetObjects:
    - {fileID: 7305805726672564427}
    subheading: MCB
    infoText: Supplies electrical power and protects the system from electrical faults.
  - id: Ultra Sonic Sensor
    targetObjects:
    - {fileID: 7000889789292035502}
    subheading: Ultra Sonic Sensor
    infoText: Uses ultrasonic sensing to measure the distance to the workpiece.
  - id: WorkPiece
    targetObjects:
    - {fileID: 2940365049198819182}
    subheading: WorkPiece
